# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# Node-RED
node_modules/
.node-red/
02-node-red-flows/out/*
!02-node-red-flows/out/.gitkeep

# Captures are large and often contain a real MAC address.
# Commit only the ones you deliberately want to show.
# 抓包文件很大且常含真实 MAC 地址，只提交你有意展示的那些。
03-iso15118-analysis/captures/*
!03-iso15118-analysis/captures/.gitkeep
!03-iso15118-analysis/captures/*.md

# Generated reports (regenerate with project 04)
report.md
*.pcap
*.pcapng

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store

# Personal working notes — local only, not part of the project.
# 个人工作笔记，仅本地保留，不属于项目内容。
AGENTS.md
docs/INTERVIEW-QA.md

# Local-only decks and scripts. docs/index.html is the published GitHub Pages
# entry point and IS tracked; everything else under docs/ stays local.
# 本地留底的展板与讲稿。docs/index.html 是 GitHub Pages 的入口，要提交；
# docs/ 下的其它 html 一律不进仓库。
docs/*.html
!docs/index.html
